calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Ripley County came in under 90% of normal in October to November in 37 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 41% of normal in July to August and 30% of normal in November to December. Grid 20256 had its driest year in 1953 at 49% of normal.</p>"}
